slides.content:
# No Media Queries Needed

`repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr))` automatically creates responsive columns. For a hybrid approach, combine with media queries to change the number of explicit columns or grid areas.

```css
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
}
```

Alternative to Grid for a card list:
```css
.cards {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.card {
  flex: 1 1 300px;
}
```
